@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Criar barbeiro (seg a sáb, 9h às 18h)
POST {{baseUrl}}/barbers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Navalha",
  "email": "carlos@barbearia.com",
  "phone": "11999998888",
  "workDays": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6],
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "18:00"
}

### Listar todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/barbers

### Listar só ativos
GET {{baseUrl}}/barbers?active=true

### ❌ Horário invertido (deve dar 400 no campo endTime)
POST {{baseUrl}}/barbers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro Tesoura",
  "email": "pedro@barbearia.com",
  "workDays": [1, 1, 9],
  "startTime": "18:00",
  "endTime": "25:00"
}

### ❌ Update que quebra a regra (início depois do fim já salvo)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/barbers/COLE-O-ID-AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "19:00"
}

### Desativar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/barbers/COLE-O-ID-AQUI